  "pseudocode": "1. Initialize ugly = [1], p2=0, p3=0, p5=0\n2. While length(ugly) < n:\n3.   next_val = min(ugly[p2]*2, ugly[p3]*3, ugly[p5]*5)\n4.   ugly.append(next_val)\n5.   if next_val == ugly[p2]*2: p2++\n6.   if next_val == ugly[p3]*3: p3++\n7.   if next_val == ugly[p5]*5: p5++",
